# Node-local plant: chat, handoffs, plans, checks, drafts, evidence, and services.
# Promote reusable behavior deliberately into tracked source and instructions.
# The whole `.mishe-*` namespace is plant-local: a typo'd `--home` or a stray
# evidence write (e.g. `.mishe-tauftauft/`) can never be staged or committed.
.mishe-*
# Settlement notes: `seed yield --file NOTES` resolves cwd-relative (plant root).
NOTES
node_modules/
artifacts/

